  "description": "Tests whether AI agents can complete multi-hour professional tasks across investment banking, corporate law, and management consulting, using real tools in Google Suite.",
  "displayName": "APEX-Agents",
  "domainsHeading": "Jobs evaluated in APEX-Agents",
  "faq": {
   "items": [
    {
     "_key": "apex-agents-faq-0",
     "answer": [
      {
       "_key": "apex-agents-faq-0-b0",
       "_type": "block",
       "children": [
        {
         "_key": "apex-agents-faq-0-b0s0",
         "_type": "span",
         "marks": [],
         "text": "The Mercor AI Productivity Index (APEX) is a family of benchmarks that measure how effectively AI models and agents perform economically valuable tasks. APEX-Agents evaluates long-horizon, multi-step workflows across high-value sectors, like corporate law, investment banking, and management consulting. It was developed in collaboration with Box and Harvey."
        }
       ],
       "markDefs": [],
       "style": "normal"
      }
     ],
     "question": "What is the APEX-Agents benchmark and how does it work?"
    },
    {
     "_key": "apex-agents-faq-1",
     "answer": [
      {
       "_key": "apex-agents-faq-1-b0",
       "_type": "block",
       "children": [
        {
         "_key": "apex-agents-faq-1-b0s0",
         "_type": "span",
         "marks": [],
         "text": "Rankings can change whenever a frontier model is released. New models are evaluated on APEX-Agents, APEX-SWE, APEX-Accounting and APEX-1 when they ship."
        }
       ],
       "markDefs": [],
       "style": "normal"
      }
     ],
     "question": "Which AI model scores highest on APEX-Agents?"
    },
    {
     "_key": "apex-agents-faq-2",
     "answer": [
      {
       "_key": "apex-agents-faq-2-b0",
       "_type": "block",
       "children": [
        {
         "_key": "apex-agents-faq-2-b0s0",
         "_type": "span",
         "marks": [],
         "text": "Practicing professionals from leading firms that the tasks simulate, including attorneys from Latham & Watkins, Skadden, and Cravath; consultants from McKinsey and BCG; and bankers from Goldman Sachs, Morgan Stanley, and JPMorgan."
        }
       ],
       "markDefs": [],
       "style": "normal"
      }
     ],
     "question": "Who writes the APEX-Agents tasks?"
    },
    {
     "_key": "apex-agents-faq-3",
     "answer": [
      {
       "_key": "apex-agents-faq-3-b0",
       "_type": "block",
       "children": [
        {
         "_key": "apex-agents-faq-3-b0s0",
         "_type": "span",
         "marks": [],
         "text": "APEX-Agents evaluates the quality of completed work. Model outputs are graded using expert-authored rubrics with an LM judge."
        }
       ],
       "markDefs": [],
       "style": "normal"
      }
     ],
     "question": "How are AI models evaluated on APEX-Agents?"
    },
    {
     "_key": "apex-agents-faq-4",
     "answer": [
      {
       "_key": "apex-agents-faq-4-b0",
       "_type": "block",
       "children": [
        {
         "_key": "apex-agents-faq-4-b0s0",
         "_type": "span",
         "marks": [],
         "text": "Mean Score measures the average percentage of criteria that are passed for all tasks in the benchmark. It is the primary metric used to rank the APEX-Agents leaderboard. Pass@1 measures the percentage of tasks that an agent successfully completes on a single attempt (i.e., scores 100% on the rubric). Together, they capture models’ overall capability and end-to-end task reliability."
        }
       ],
       "markDefs": [],
       "style": "normal"
      }
     ],
     "question": "What do Mean Score and Pass@1 measure?"
    },
    {
     "_key": "apex-agents-faq-5",
     "answer": [
      {
       "_key": "apex-agents-faq-5-b0",
       "_type": "block",
       "children": [
        {
         "_key": "apex-agents-faq-5-b0s0",
         "_type": "span",
         "marks": [],
         "text": "Yes, on the open subset. The eval harness is published on GitHub and sample tasks are on HuggingFace, so you can run the same scoring pipeline against your own model. The full task set stays private so that models can't be trained on it."
        }
       ],
       "markDefs": [],
       "style": "normal"
      }
     ],
     "question": "Can I reproduce APEX-Agents results myself?"
    },
    {
     "_key": "apex-agents-faq-6",
     "answer": [
      {
       "_key": "apex-agents-faq-6-b0",
       "_type": "block",
       "children": [
        {
         "_key": "apex-agents-faq-6-b0s0",
         "_type": "span",
         "marks": [],
         "text": "Yes. Mercor licenses off-the-shelf datasets built by the same expert network. 50,000+ tasks across 30+ domains, with samples available the same day. "
        },
        {
         "_key": "apex-agents-faq-6-b0s1",
         "_type": "span",
         "marks": [
          "apex-agents-faq-6-b0l1"
         ],
         "text": "Learn more about off-the-shelf data"
        },
        {
